{
  "description": [
    {
      "content": "<p>GridSeparators are not <em>required</em> but they are <em>recommended</em> as they improve keyboard accessibility.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p>A separator resizes either the columns or the rows of a Grid:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>&lt;GridSeparator column={1} /&gt;</code> is rendered between columns 0 and 1 (and spans all rows)</li>\n<li><code>&lt;GridSeparator row={1} /&gt;</code> is rendered between rows 0 and 1 (and spans all columns)</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p>Separators can also span a subset of the opposite axis (e.g. <code>&lt;GridSeparator column={1} rowStart={1} rowSpan={2} /&gt;</code>).</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p>Where column and row separators intersect, dragging resizes both axes.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p>GridSeparators support the same props and attributes as Separators:</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "content": "<div><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">&#60;</span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">div</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-propertyName\">data-separator</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-propertyName\">data-testid</span><span class=\"tok-operator\">=</span><span class=\"tok-string\">\"separator-id-prop\"</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-propertyName\">id</span><span class=\"tok-operator\">=</span><span class=\"tok-string\">\"separator-id-prop\"</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-propertyName\">role</span><span class=\"tok-operator\">=</span><span class=\"tok-string\">\"separator\"</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">&#62;</span></div>"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p>GridSeparator elements must be direct DOM children of their parent Grid elements.</p>\n",
      "intent": "warning"
    }
  ],
  "filePath": "lib/components/grid/GridSeparator.tsx",
  "name": "GridSeparator",
  "props": {
    "className": {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>CSS class name.</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p>Use the <code>data-separator</code> attribute for custom <em>hover</em> and <em>active</em> styles</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p>The following properties cannot be overridden: <code>flex-grow</code>, <code>flex-shrink</code></p>\n",
          "intent": "warning"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-variableName\"><span class=\"tok-propertyName\">className</span></span><span class=\"tok-operator\">?</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-variableName\">string</span></div>",
      "name": "className",
      "required": false
    },
